# ==============================================================================
# CANDIDATE PROFILE & AUTOMATION CONFIGURATION (TEMPLATE)
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env:
#    cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace all placeholder values below with your real details.
# 3. .env is strictly ignored by git and will NEVER be pushed.
# 4. Verify your active profile anytime via:
#    python3 cli.py check-profile
# ==============================================================================

